{'symbol': 'HII', 'date': '2021-06-11 11:30:00', 'title': 'VIDEO RELEASE — HUNTINGTON INGALLS INDUSTRIES LAUNCHES FIRST FLIGHT III GUIDED MISSILE DESTROYER JACK H. LUCAS (DDG 125)', 'text': "PASCAGOULA, MISS., JUNE 11, 2021 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- TODAY, HUNTINGTON INGALLS INDUSTRIES' (NYSE: HII) INGALLS SHIPBUILDING DIVISION ANNOUNCED THE SUCCESSFUL LAUNCH OF THE NAVY'S FIRST FLIGHT III ARLEIGH BURKE-CLASS (DDG 51) GUIDED MISSILE DESTROYER JACK H. LUCAS (DDG 125)."}